" strong="G3056" x-morph="N-NMP" x-position="9" x-lemma="λόγοι">words</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756" x-morph="Adv" x-position="11" x-lemma="οὐ">will never</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361" x-empty="true" x-morph="Adv" x-position="12" x-lemma="μὴ"/><char style="w" strong="G3928" x-morph="V-ASA-3P" x-position="13" x-lemma="παρέλθωσιν">pass away.</char></char></para>
  <para style="s1">Readiness at Any Hour</para>
