 x-morph="Conj" x-position="1" x-lemma="καὶ">And</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756" x-empty="true" x-morph="Adv" x-position="2" x-lemma="οὐκ"/><char style="w" strong="G1097" x-morph="V-AIA-3P" x-position="3" x-lemma="ἔγνωσαν">they were oblivious</char> <char style="w" strong="G2193" x-morph="Conj" x-position="4" x-lemma="ἕως">until</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-morph="Art-NMS" x-position="6" x-lemma="ὁ">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2627" x-morph="N-NMS" x-position="7" x-lemma="κατακλυσμὸς">flood</char> <char style="w" strong="G2064" x-morph="V-AIA-3S" x-position="5" x-lemma="ἦλθεν">came</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532" x-morph="Conj" x-position="8" x-lemma="καὶ">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G142" x-morph="V-AIA-3S" x-position="9" x-lemma="ἦρεν">swept them all away.</char> <char style="w" strong="G537" x-empty="true" x-morph="Adj-AMP" x-position="10" x-lemma="ἅπαντας"/><char style="w" strong="G2532" x-empty="true" x-morph="Conj" x-position="13" x-lemma="καὶ"/><char style="w" strong="G3779" x-morph="Adv" x-position="11" x-lemma="οὕτως">So</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510" x-morph="V-FIM-3S" x-position="12" x-lemma="ἔσται">will it be</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-morph="Art-NFS" x-position="14" x-lemma="ἡ">at the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3952" x-morph="N-NFS" x-position="15" x-lemma="παρουσία">coming</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-morph="Art-GMS" x-position="16" x-lemma="τοῦ">of the</char> <char style="w" strong="G5207" x-morph="N-GMS" x-position="17" x-lemma="Υἱοῦ">Son</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-empty="true" x-morph="Art-GMS" x-position="18" x-lemma="τοῦ"/><char style="w" strong="G444" x-morph="N-GMS" x-position="19" x-lemma="ἀνθρώπου">of Man.</char> <verse style="v" number="40"/><char style="w" strong="G5119" x-empty="true" x-morph="Adv" x-position="1" x-lemma="τότε"/><char style="w" strong="G1417" x-morph="Adj-NMP" x-position="3" x-lemma="δύο">Two men</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510" x-mo